    "type": "game",
    "name": "Machicanti",
    "steam_appid": 3817160,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! This is our newest and latest experiment: A non-linear sequencer with isometric view. It looks like an RTS game where you can make music with it. Interesting isn't it?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/40deaa383249c8e6c31de40044cf2f15.avif?t=1750297520\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main way of adding entities to the map is the colorful keyboard/piano in the middle part of the bottom of the screen:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/c596efe55bb5ef1cc41bffb72fb26b8b.avif?t=1750297520\" width=800 height=182 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a full piano octave, each color represent the different notes. In order to create a note a press &amp; drag is needed. Release the button where you want the note to be placed.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/340ff58096060debba0f2fef0ed4bc47.avif?t=1750297520\" data-has-big width=800 height=928 /></span>Look how the blue note (the first note we placed) have a liquid seed like shape over it, that's where the music begins. A column with a seed over it are called Launcher nodes. You can have as many as launcher nodes as you want. More about this later... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nodes we created are not connected with each other, this means that the blue node will play a C note and that's all your song so far. Let's connect them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/f5441c3cffb2dbb8e525b84f8b9b4447.avif?t=1750297520\" data-has-big width=800 height=478 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the link tool and drag from the blue node to the green node!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/64139e3b3826685f8dfe62f823c9b425.avif?t=1750297520\" data-has-big width=800 height=510 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After you connect them, they will loke like this:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/0b833ebcb3da88696be5dcc2ba29b1d9.avif?t=1750297520\" data-has-big width=800 height=530 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mini tune will play a C (blue) note, and after some time a D (green) note. The time between each note is relative to the distance. <br><br> <br>You can create as many notes and connections as you want. Select multiple notes with the &quot;SELECT&quot; tool, and move them one by one or in group with the &quot;MOVE&quot; tool. Copy and paste is also something you can do! <br> <br>The &quot;TWEAK&quot; tool allows you to move notes around, changing the global shape of the network without losing the relative distance between each other. They will adjust themselves allowing you to re arrange the notes without modifying how the song sounds.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/788cadda330ed0375e8dc747e1e1e2d9.avif?t=1750297520\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chords can also be a thing! Simply put several nodes really close together! <br> <br>----- <br> <br>Those are the basics! <br> <br>You can change of course the sound of each node by pressing this button: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/baf6be0761f50a120434b6db58560d3e.avif?t=1750297520\" data-has-big width=800 height=544 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a lot of different instruments to choose from! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/22714199cadc1d1702e0080c2a7f6264.avif?t=1750297520\" data-has-big width=800 height=646 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In the full version you'll be able to import your own samples or record stuff directly from your microphone! <br> <br>You can change the octave of the instruments here: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/cda1de2557c8550040c74bff925e4aee.avif?t=1750297520\" data-has-big width=800 height=622 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tempo of your song can be tweaked by dragging up/down. Or directly tapping at the rhythm! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/fdc8172d593b81c896bd55823a464a95.avif?t=1750297520\" width=800 height=736 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appart from notes, you can place effects and set/unset if a note is a launcher or not by selecting an effect from this selector wheel!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/05f21af0261846be86f57a5c7325339b.avif?t=1750297520\" width=380 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the full family so far! Volume effect, on switch, off switch, normal temperature pass/no pass, freezed temperature pass/no pass. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/1f3f86f01340e9e34c7814fae72b142a.avif?t=1750297520\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to experiment with those effect nodes!<br><br>We created a lot of demo for you to learn an listen, press here to play them!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/14d3a2f03b0da6c3a978c59124c2da12.avif?t=1750297520\" width=776 height=660 /></span><br><br>Have fun! <br>Any feedback is appreciated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! This is our newest and latest experiment: A non-linear sequencer with isometric view. It looks like an RTS game where you can make music with it. Interesting isn't it?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/40deaa383249c8e6c31de40044cf2f15.avif?t=1750297520\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main way of adding entities to the map is the colorful keyboard/piano in the middle part of the bottom of the screen:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/c596efe55bb5ef1cc41bffb72fb26b8b.avif?t=1750297520\" width=800 height=182 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a full piano octave, each color represent the different notes. In order to create a note a press &amp; drag is needed. Release the button where you want the note to be placed.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/340ff58096060debba0f2fef0ed4bc47.avif?t=1750297520\" data-has-big width=800 height=928 /></span>Look how the blue note (the first note we placed) have a liquid seed like shape over it, that's where the music begins. A column with a seed over it are called Launcher nodes. You can have as many as launcher nodes as you want. More about this later... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nodes we created are not connected with each other, this means that the blue node will play a C note and that's all your song so far. Let's connect them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/f5441c3cffb2dbb8e525b84f8b9b4447.avif?t=1750297520\" data-has-big width=800 height=478 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the link tool and drag from the blue node to the green node!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/64139e3b3826685f8dfe62f823c9b425.avif?t=1750297520\" data-has-big width=800 height=510 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After you connect them, they will loke like this:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/0b833ebcb3da88696be5dcc2ba29b1d9.avif?t=1750297520\" data-has-big width=800 height=530 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mini tune will play a C (blue) note, and after some time a D (green) note. The time between each note is relative to the distance. <br><br> <br>You can create as many notes and connections as you want. Select multiple notes with the &quot;SELECT&quot; tool, and move them one by one or in group with the &quot;MOVE&quot; tool. Copy and paste is also something you can do! <br> <br>The &quot;TWEAK&quot; tool allows you to move notes around, changing the global shape of the network without losing the relative distance between each other. They will adjust themselves allowing you to re arrange the notes without modifying how the song sounds.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/788cadda330ed0375e8dc747e1e1e2d9.avif?t=1750297520\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chords can also be a thing! Simply put several nodes really close together! <br> <br>----- <br> <br>Those are the basics! <br> <br>You can change of course the sound of each node by pressing this button: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/baf6be0761f50a120434b6db58560d3e.avif?t=1750297520\" data-has-big width=800 height=544 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a lot of different instruments to choose from! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/22714199cadc1d1702e0080c2a7f6264.avif?t=1750297520\" data-has-big width=800 height=646 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In the full version you'll be able to import your own samples or record stuff directly from your microphone! <br> <br>You can change the octave of the instruments here: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/cda1de2557c8550040c74bff925e4aee.avif?t=1750297520\" data-has-big width=800 height=622 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tempo of your song can be tweaked by dragging up/down. Or directly tapping at the rhythm! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/fdc8172d593b81c896bd55823a464a95.avif?t=1750297520\" width=800 height=736 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appart from notes, you can place effects and set/unset if a note is a launcher or not by selecting an effect from this selector wheel!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/05f21af0261846be86f57a5c7325339b.avif?t=1750297520\" width=380 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the full family so far! Volume effect, on switch, off switch, normal temperature pass/no pass, freezed temperature pass/no pass. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/1f3f86f01340e9e34c7814fae72b142a.avif?t=1750297520\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to experiment with those effect nodes!<br><br>We created a lot of demo for you to learn an listen, press here to play them!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817160/extras/14d3a2f03b0da6c3a978c59124c2da12.avif?t=1750297520\" width=776 height=660 /></span><br><br>Have fun! <br>Any feedback is appreciated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
